# CodeQL hygiene (hard)

- Security UI is **branch:main only**. Unmerged PR fixes do not clear alerts.
- Before security-clean claims: `node tools/codeql-agent-hygiene.js --claim "…"`.
- Before commit: `node tools/codeql-pattern-gate.js --staged` (also pre-commit).
- Use helpers: `tools/lib/asc-jwt-es256.js`, `safe-url-host.js`, `safe-html-strip.js`, `safe-exec.js`.
- Never open a parallel CodeQL burn-down while PR #1371 (or successor) is open.
- Detail: docs/agents/codeql-orchestration.md
